{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_04_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e3b6304f56e20142af847b60eb087c50d3a9b8dcc7d4937fc3c49e76b470ed0c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c611dd91d7ba699f3e1e8b6e94ee1452756f51f6f35d08a9f32c1128cf44b58",
      "text": "来试镜的路上，\n本来打算从某栋楼前路过～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f12aac08041736d9fa3714cffc0ff88349a475f2ae06543c78c756f537e1a71",
      "text": "结果那里的一个男人对我说“最好别去”，\n我就绕了别的路呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e39118e01502f75479c8e67eab9e751d7464682c12f9f73ff9f16a7689aba415",
      "text": "我也遇到了同样的事，于是绕了道。\n然后，到了这里之后才听说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0d9dbb929c63e1dc8ee4016e40b7d0d9a15a3dce163438f23cdcb5e8fc8a75",
      "text": "在我绕道的时候，一辆卡车冲上了那条路的人行道，\n发生了货物散落一地的事故。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ce0a0d1a9e92d35b5ede1b77fc72399646b77699c297901bfc08ffd268fd7e",
      "text": "网络新闻都报道了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0ece940fbcbf524b6cf93495d1159e62fa2cc7ea2b7f04284ab26f6cd1724f",
      "text": "要是走了那条路的话，\n可能就赶不上试镜了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ba3bbc2c5bd6ec893e8310e0054842ccf527f6f05b437b70eaa7145c52a0e5",
      "text": "居然有这种事……\n两位都没事，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9545b371e1b729f5424e6e07349f83ee54f90f9983475b4fb4722145ab859d61",
      "text": "听说包括我们在内，没有一个人受伤哦。\n想必是多亏了那位男性的提醒吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95cd175440a88cd29f270404df268c7c928c79d5a136ca6e2ee377878e98a34",
      "text": "真是个奇妙的人呢～\n难道说，他早就知道会发生事故了吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9afa631be222ca76a0c2e91a22e40e8bbb51695a3711012b39b0a4740c08fb",
      "text": "那位男性，长什么样子？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fefd055a3ab44aa7d24d9adf9cf5b6fa2e8476e2d4f6f510dbf5ba7247bfc52f",
      "text": "是个高个子的男人哦～\n而且，打扮得好像保洁人员的样子呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_04_1_1_015_04:1_1_015_04_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e291b6190ab9585b61b8b79e16f0a19c3e1b828c60b178d86b833ee68b9694",
      "text": "（……！一定，就是那个人）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
